{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國英格蘭奧克蘭主教鎮的聖約翰天主教學校暨六年級學院，針對學生可能因《GTA6》發售而缺課的情況，推出僅限發售日當天的出勤挑戰。正常到校並完成全天課程的學生，可以參加一張65英鎊亞馬遜禮品卡的抽獎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586844.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:21:09.584821+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:57:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:14.878064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:14.878064+00:00","content_hash":"9de496f6f6430691d6c2b08cfb88f2fedd95d64d8e2f50df930dcef11ed38bc4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}